Rule 2 (At least one tensor is provided)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) ≥ 0
>>
Rule 3 (The shapes of the input tensors are compatible for broadcasting)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) > ndim(v_2) then ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_2) - 1] : (shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - ndim(v_2) + i) = shape(v_2, i) ∨ shape(v_2, i) = 1) else ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : (shape(v_2, ndim(v_2) - ndim(v_1) + i) = shape(v_1, i) ∨ shape(v_1, i) = 1)
