Rule 4 (If one tensor has a dimension of size 1, all other tensors must either have a dimension of size 1 at that index or no dimension at all)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= if ∃i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) = 1 then ∀j ∈ [0, ndim(v_2) - 1] : (if i < ndim(v_2) then shape(v_2, i) = 1)
>>
Rule 5 (If any tensor has ndim = 0, all others must have ndim = 0 as well)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) = 0 then ndim(v_2) = 0
>>
Rule 6 (If both tensors have dimensions, their trailing dimensions must either be equal or one of them is 1)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) > 0 ∧ ndim(v_2) > 0 then (shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 1) = shape(v_2, ndim(v_2) - 1) ∨ shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 1) = 1 ∨ shape(v_2, ndim(v_2) - 1) = 1)
>>
Rule 7 (The number of dimensions in the tensors is not excessively large)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) < 10
>>
Rule 8 (If a tensor has no dimensions then all others have no dimensions)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= (ndim(v_1) = 0) ∨ (ndim(v_2) = 0)
>>
Rule 9 (If the number of dimensions is different, the tensor with smaller number of dimensions should be treated as if it has 1 prepended)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) < ndim(v_2) then ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : (shape(v_1, i) = shape(v_2, ndim(v_2) - ndim(v_1) + i) ∨ shape(v_1, i) = 1 ∨ shape(v_2, ndim(v_2) - ndim(v_1) + i) = 1)
>>
Rule 10 (For all dimensions, the size of the resulting tensor must be equal to the maximum size along each dimension among all the input tensors)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) > ndim(v_2) then ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_2) - 1] : (shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - ndim(v_2) + i) ≥ shape(v_2, i)) else ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : (shape(v_2, ndim(v_2) - ndim(v_1) + i) ≥ shape(v_1, i))
>>
Rule 11 (Broadcasting can only happen between tensors with equal dimensions or when one of the dimensions is of size 1)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [0, if ndim(v_1) < ndim(v_2) then ndim(v_1) else ndim(v_2)] : (shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - i -1) = shape(v_2, ndim(v_2) - i - 1)) ∨ (shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - i - 1) = 1) ∨ (shape(v_2, ndim(v_2) - i - 1) = 1)
