Rule 12 (If one tensor is a scalar, then the other must also be a scalar or must be broadcastable to a scalar.)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) = 0 then (ndim(v_2) = 0) else if ndim(v_2) = 0 then (ndim(v_1) = 0)
